+| de | 16,187 (99.29%) | 120.14 | 99 | 16,098 | 83.16% | 1,107 | 9,796 |
+| sv | 5,670 (88.86%) | 56.88 | 54 | 5,077 | 98.15% | 16 | 167 |
+| fr | 6,174 (99.53%) | 114.11 | 75 | 6,009 | 77.11% | 714 | 2,596 |
