+| pt | 4,290 (99.10%) | 90.79 | 83.5 | 4,197 | 68.93% | 2 | 2,243 |
+| es | 4,193 (99.86%) | 139.07 | 128 | 4,154 | 76.53% | 687 | 2,522 |
+| zh | 2,952 (93.18%) | 24.99 | 25.5 | 2,680 | 86.65% | 0 | 0 |
